\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Cryptographic building blocks from problems in group theory

We would like to use computational problems in group theory to derive fundamental cryptographic objects including one-way functions and multilinear maps. \href{http://aimpl.org/postquantgroup/3/}{[S2]}
